@Isotr0py Thanks for the guidance. I’ve now moved the Nemotron 3.5 ASR implementation to a standalone OOT plugin: https://github.com/Sohaib-Ahmed21/vllm-nemotron-asr-plugin

I’ve also updated this PR to remove the in-tree implementation and keep only the minimal `Nemotron3_5AsrForRNNT` OOT mapping/docs references.

Could you please review the plugin implementation/code as well and advise on the preferred direction going forward? In particular, if this should eventually be moved under `vllm-project`, I can do that and update the references in this PR accordingly.

